WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Lie on your back with both legs extended and soft.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Hug the right knee in, then loop a strap around the ball of the right foot.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Extend the right leg toward the sky, keeping the left leg grounded.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Flex the right foot and gently walk the hands up the strap.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Lower the right leg and switch sides.
